{{CreatureDrops|stars=0}}

== Spawning ==
{{spawn table|
{{spawn row|type=[[Spawn zones|Anywhere]] in [[Deep North]], during the day and night, alone|limit=1|stars=No|frequency=2}}
}}

Barkas spawn dormant. They wake up when a player comes within 20m, or when a player's noise within 50m reaches them.

== Attacks and abilities ==
All of the Barka's attacks deal Tier 3 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage, and also hit [[Factions|allied creatures]].

=== Heavy swing ===
Deals 160 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 [[Damage types#Frost|Frost]], 60 Chop and 30 Pickaxe damage in an 8-meter, 90-degree horizontal arc. It can be used every 7 seconds when within 3-9 meters of a target.

=== Slam drive ===
Deals 180 Blunt, 100 Frost, 50 Chop and 25 Pickaxe damage in a 9-meter, 50-degree vertical arc, with twice the knockback of its other attacks. It can be used every 7 seconds when within 10-20 meters of a target.

=== Whip flurry ===
Deals 100 Blunt, 100 Frost, 25 Chop and 10 Pickaxe damage in a 10-meter, 160-degree horizontal arc. It can be used every 7 seconds when within 1-10 meters of a target.

=== Whip slam ===
Deals 100 Blunt, 100 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]], 40 Frost, 50 Chop and 30 Pickaxe damage in a 9-meter, 50-degree vertical arc. It can be used every 7 seconds when within 4-12 meters of a target.

=== Back slam ===
Deals 190 Blunt, 80 Frost and 40 Chop damage. It is set up for targets behind the Barka, within 3-12 meters, and has a 3-second cooldown.

